- General
    - when making UI components they need to be user friendly, use playwright to see if the ui is user friendly or not

- Global events tab
    - more fake events and participants
    - add filters for events table
    - remove target enrichment blocker, as the contact goes to the enrichment queue and thats where the enrichment actually happens
    - editing an event doesnt actually close the popup and save it
    - adding event does not close the popup and submit changes
    - option to add participants in event detail
    - when adding an event and inputting the address it should then appear on the map
    - when a record is clicked it should highlight where on the map it is

- Global incidents tab
    - only add to watchlist or reject buttons. adding to watchlist automatically assumes the incident was corroborated, same goes for the incident detail page
    - incidents table should have filters
    - ability to edit incident details

- Watchlist tab
    - when company is added, it should automatically monitor by default
    - monitoring column does not update in the table and neither does last run when toggling the pause/enable button
    - table should have filters


- Review tab
    - in contact enrichment queue discover domain fails with error 500
    - the review tab should only be for contacts not incidents, adjust the fake data accordingly
    - in the enrichment queue: 
        - should also have a button for finidng email
        - there should be a button called bulk discover domain and bulk discover email similar to bulk approve/reject in review tab
        - if the discovery fails for either one it goes to analyst review
        - if discovery succeeds then bring it to the crm export tab 
    - the review tab should have an open button for every entry so that the analyst can go in and edit the domain and email and other information manually or optionally leave it blank and approve it to the crm export
    - SLA and version is uneccesary
    - fields should be: name, company, domain, email, date added, open button, action (approve or reject)

- CRM Exports tab
    - change the fake data to just contacts as it is only contacts that go into the crm
    - add an open button that allows the user to see details of that candidate with the option to edit it as well

- Sequences
    - sequences definitions should have an option to be deleted
    - look at the UI it is very ugly and has a large textbox use playwright to see it and make it prettier
    - creating sequence definitions is also ugly, textbox with the raw json is not user friendly
        - the sequence should be defined in layers, so you input step 1 then click and "add layer" button where you can configure step 2 etc
    - crm prospect import is also ugly 
    - for sequence activities there should be an open button that shows that record along with the email that was generated (for demo use a fake one) and it should be editable.
    - CRM prospect import filters do not work
    - once cancelled the record should disappear from the table 
